From e0a30ac662541218f97103c6e29fcd3bd74ea28f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hacen <hacenbm144@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:15:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] phy: exynos5-usbdrd: make Exynos 2200 USB 3 work

- add the PIPE3 instance; its init boots the SNPS USBDP combo PHY (kxusbdp.c)
- give exynos2200 its 'ref' core clock (extrefclk) and hold the clocks .init->.exit
- clear HSP_MISC RES_TUNE before setting it (2-bit field)
- pulse the link reset; keep the eUSB2 PHY reset owned by its register

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Zi6dy8kB9rd8PzqHkWkui
